{"type": "sena", "labs": [{"stimuli": [{"template_override": 1, "_data": [], "type": "welcome", "contents": [{}], "id": 0}, {"template_override": 1, "_data": [], "type": "audio", "title": "", "contents": [{"type": "slideshow", "value": {"audiosrc": "engenn9le04ob05re2aud01", "coverimg": "engenn9le04ob05re2img01.jpg", "images": [{"image": "engenn9le04ob05re2img01.jpg", "text": "", "time": "0", "id": 0}, {"image": "engenn9le04ob05re2img01.jpg", "text": "So, I've been having a few problems at work lately. I asked myself what I could do about it. A friend told me I had to learn more about managing my emotions. I had heard the term Emotional Intelligence and decided to find out more about it. I should have read about it before now because it is very interesting to me. Having this information last week could have helped me with my interactions with my boss.", "time": "100", "id": 1}, {"image": "engenn9le04ob05re2img02.jpg", "text": "Emotional Intelligence (EI) is how we describe our ability to recognize both our own emotions and the emotions of others. Further, it helps us not only to differentiate between different feelings, but also to be able to label them. From there, we are able to use that emotional information to help guide the way we think and behave. When you look at studies, they show that those people who have a high EI are generally in better mental health, show stronger job performance, and are more potent in their leadership skills. If you have Emotional Intelligence you can understand the emotions of other people.", "time": "26500", "id": 2}, {"image": "engenn9le04ob05re2img03.jpg", "text": "A co-worker told me I needed to learn to communicate clearly and manage conflict. I probably would have coped better with stress at work if I had been more familiar with EI. Apparently it's possible to boost your EI level. A higher EI can improve your performance at work. It does this by helping you navigate through the workplace and its social complexities. This allows you to lead and inspire while excelling in your own career. People at work said that I could be more productive if I could communicate better. I should have done this research a long time ago!", "time": "67000", "id": 3}]}}], "id": 1}], "exercises": [{"template_override": 1, "type": "WLC", "img_path": "", "questions": [], "_data": [{"type": "instructions", "contents": [{"content": " I can talk about reactions and behavior.", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": " I can talk about hypothetical situations about the past.", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": " I can quote other people.", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": " What do you do to cope with communication problems at work or at home?", "type": "Free Header Item"}, {"content": " What are some ways that you could increase your Emotional Intelligence?", "type": "Free Header Item"}]}, {"type": "group", "contents": [{"content": "Welcome", "type": "group_name"}]}, {"content": {"allowed_attempts": 2, "incorrect_feedback": [{"content": "try again", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Maybe next time", "type": "text"}], "correct_feedback": "Correct", "attempt_feedback": [{"content": "You have 2 tries", "type": "text"}, {"content": "you have 1 attempt left", "type": "text"}]}, "type": "feedback"}, {"content": "Ask your partner:", "type": "free_header_text"}, {"content": "How does Emotional Intelligence help at work?", "type": "free_type_text_area"}], "id": 0, "stimuli_ids": [0]}, {"template_override": 1, "type": "STI", "questions": [{"responses": [{"_data": [{"content": "", "type": "text"}], "id": 0, "correct": 0, "selected": 0}, {"_data": [{"content": "", "type": "text"}], "id": 1, "correct": 1, "selected": 0}], "_data": [{"type": "question", "contents": [{"content": "", "type": "text"}]}], "id": 0}], "_data": [{"type": "instructions", "contents": [{"content": " Sally blogs about <span class=\"tool-tip\" id=\"tip_1_0\">Emotional Intelligence</span>.", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "group", "contents": [{"c